    "message": "docs: record force-composed video-plane decision (ADR-0002 + shell contract)\n\nDocument the alt-tab monitor flash root cause (DWM promoting the video\nswapchain to independent-flip/MPO on focus edges, re-training the DSC/VRR\nlink) and the fix (sub-unity opacity pins the plane to DWM composition).\nCaptures the SDR coupling caveat (forcing composition defeats HDR\npassthrough) and the PresentMon grading method.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
